required_facts.statement:
Pin the approved provider version with this declaration, substituting the approved version:
terraform {
  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "= APPROVED_VERSION"
    }
  }
}

Configure the already-provisioned backend using line-separated HCL arguments:
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket = "BUCKET"
    key = "KEY"
    region = "REGION"
  }
}
Use the supplied bucket, key, Region and protection settings.
